Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(414,450)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,676)}奢华生活文摘
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个能不能别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you two be quiet?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.95,0:01:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是不能了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Didn't think so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个呆头到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you barnacle-heads doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星在练我们最爱的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I are practicing our favorite noises
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.49,0:01:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的是海豚笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mine is a dolphin, laughing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.26,0:01:43.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的是蓝鲸的悲歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:43.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And my favorite is the plaintive song of the blue whale
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.70,0:01:50.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听见没
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:50.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Frank?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.25,0:01:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那首歌  听起来像玛莎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That song, it sounds just like Martha
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,法兰克  得跟你强调多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Frank, how many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玛莎不适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Martha's no good for you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.17,0:01:59.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一点都不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:01:59.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's just no good
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.62,0:02:05.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要练这么难听的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:05.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to practice such horrible sounds?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是一个活动  出自我们最爱的杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's one of the activities in our favorite magazine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.77,0:02:08.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,头脑简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:08.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,simple-ton
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:11.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(266,402)}头脑简单\N一大堆简单事
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一大堆简单事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A ton of simple things to do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想必很挑战你们的智商吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must be very mentally challenging for you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.39,0:02:15.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:15.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  让我更有聪明相了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it made me look more smartlike
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,杂志上说接下来应该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What does the magazine say we should do next?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, let's take a look
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.05,0:02:26.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这期能做的好像都做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:26.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we've done everything in this issue
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个还没做
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Except for this one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.40,0:02:29.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好朋友测试
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:29.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The best friend quiz
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.05,0:02:31.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真的了解你最好的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:31.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you really know your best friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.75,0:02:32.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这应该挺简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:32.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This should be easy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星互相可了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I know everything about each other
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.45,0:02:39.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就在你们的白痴互助会里好好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you two have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with your mutual ignoramus society
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.82,0:02:42.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:42.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morons
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.68,0:02:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye again
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.87,0:02:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先来  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You go first, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.30,0:02:45.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:45.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.97,0:02:47.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先请  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.97,0:02:47.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you, old buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.95,0:02:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Au contraire
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先请  吾友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you, mon ami
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.22,0:02:52.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托你先请  哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:52.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, after you, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不不不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先请  最最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you, bestest--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧定一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just pick one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.51,0:03:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然再砸你们三次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And there's another three where that came from
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.05,0:03:01.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:01.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go first
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第一题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Question one
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友最爱的颜色是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is your best friend's favorite color?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aquamarine
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很不想泼你冷水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate to burst your bubble
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我最爱的颜色是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but my favorite color is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是海蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is aquamarine
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.82,0:03:18.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉怀疑你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:18.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry I doubted you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.00,0:03:19.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:19.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.92,0:03:23.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友是右撇子还是左撇子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:23.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is your best friend right- or left-handed?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,答案是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The answer is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.32,0:03:25.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,右撇子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:25.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right-handed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:28.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,612)}派大星厉害
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很简单  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Simple, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你就是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's because you're my best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最好朋友的肚脐眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is your best friend's bellybutton
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.80,0:03:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是凹的还是凸的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an inny or an outy?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.65,0:03:40.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不许偷看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:40.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No peeking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用不着偷看  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to peek, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.93,0:03:45.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我闭着眼睛都能回答
