Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:04.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,right, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.56,0:07:06.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:06.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:10.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(548,204)}冰淇淋
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ice cream
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like your best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全算不上朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,isn't a friend at all
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你买了冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got you an ice cream
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  最好的朋友派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, best friend Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是你的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's your favorite
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,腌椰菜卷配芥末  多加培根粒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,dill pickle swirl with mustard and extra bacon bits
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  这是你最爱的冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, this is your favorite ice cream
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.57,0:07:32.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的是香草味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:32.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My favorite is plain vanilla
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我就多了个冰淇淋能吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, more ice cream for me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.80,0:07:40.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能借用五块钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:40.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I borrow five bucks?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.85,0:07:42.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:42.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.57,0:07:45.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肮脏臭钱送你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:45.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take your dirty, rotten money
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从今往后都不了解你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't even know you anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.02,0:07:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是不想吃冰淇淋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess he didn't want any ice cream
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1032,816)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.45,0:08:15.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:15.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It just isn't fair
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正谁需要派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who needs Patrick, anyways?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.37,0:08:23.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以后的日子我要好好过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:23.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rest of my life, here I come
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.51,0:08:26.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:26.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, there, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.29,0:08:28.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坚强点  坚强点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:28.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be strong, be strong
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下午好  派大星先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Mr. Star
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.77,0:08:33.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:33.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See ya later
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was awful
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Truly awful
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们完全就跟陌生人一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were like complete strangers
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.85,0:08:47.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用不着事事都了解你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:46.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about your best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正因为这样  友情才有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what keeps the friendship interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你跟派大星只是需要分开一小会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe you and Patrick just need some time apart
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.59,0:08:56.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没派大星  我自个去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:56.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have lots of fun without Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好个爱哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a crybaby
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.64,0:09:07.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不需要派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:07.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.15,0:09:10.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我自己一个也能玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:10.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can have a good time all by myself
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能去捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could go jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星从前经常捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I used to go jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能玩跳山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could play leap frog
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能吹泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could blow bubbles
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.37,0:09:32.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:32.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe not
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.88,0:09:37.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:37.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.01,0:09:42.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能让他看到我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:42.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't let him see me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他好像完全就没在想念我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, he doesn't seem to be missing me at all
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.20,0:09:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真棒  这么快就把咱友情不当回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice that he's gotten over our friendship so quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:05.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,544)}健身房
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星去健身房健身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick works out at the gym?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还跟龙虾拉里一起混
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And he's hanging out with Larry the lobster?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我也不怎么了解派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't know much about Patrick either
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:20.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940,568)}厨具
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星买厨具
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick shopping for cookery?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very suspicious
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's coming back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:45.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(906,258)}魔术店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:50.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(354,370)}魔术帽
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我站住  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是来看你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were just coming to see you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想必你是来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you were
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我说你交了新好朋友拉里  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To tell me about your new best friend Larry, I suppose?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急  小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Settle down, little dude
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不想被卷进这种
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get in the middle of whatever
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乱七八糟的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然拉里很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,While Larry is a great guy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多才多艺  长得又帅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with loads of talent and good looks
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.10,0:11:15.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可神了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:15.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He is pretty amazing
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.12,0:11:18.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但他不是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:18.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's not my best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他只是想帮我买个礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was just helping me buy a present?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.65,0:11:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,买给谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who for?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.60,0:11:22.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:22.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.35,0:11:26.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  给我真正最好的朋友海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:26.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, for my real best friend SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我太爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.35,0:11:36.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你了解我  最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:36.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do know me, best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也给自己买了一副
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got a pair for me too
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是最最好的朋友了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the bestest best friend, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好不好看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道  神秘陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How should I know, mysterious stranger?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.92,0:11:50.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,何必找我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:50.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:54.81,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}手套隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:59.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:59.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(411.575,444)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:59.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(531.742,698)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:05.66,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(926,668)}手套乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍快点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, come on
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.37,0:12:12.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手套隧道的队伍越排越长了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:12.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The line for tunnel of glove is filling up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,498)}手套隧道
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱就是说  一定会很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be so totally, like, fun
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你干嘛找我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, why are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是你男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.34,0:12:27.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是男的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:27.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I am a boy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.02,0:12:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是她朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I am her friend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你先站这一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, stand here for a second
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.64,0:12:43.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该定格这一刻  当作传家宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:43.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just thought we should keep this moment for posterity
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.45,0:12:48.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍有男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:48.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl's got a boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍有男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl's got a boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道你有女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had a girlfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.04,0:12:52.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:52.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.91,0:12:55.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他不是我男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:55.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He is not my boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.45,0:12:56.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么快就分了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:56.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fast
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.17,0:13:00.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海角何处无芳草
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:00.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of fish in the streetcar
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之  进去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go to the ride
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.37,0:13:06.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,代我向蟹老板问好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:06.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell Mr. Krabs I said, "hi"
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们走吧  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's bounce, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.25,0:13:09.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:09.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:14.60,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(912,222)}棉花糖
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Busy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you later
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请坐在座位上  等待船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please remain seated till the boat comes to--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.14,0:13:20.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:20.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.80,0:13:25.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一车只能两位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:25.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only two per car
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只能等下一车了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll have to wait for the next car
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有落单的游客  请上前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Any single riders, come to the front
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是落单的游客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a single rider
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.06,0:13:32.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:32.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.53,0:13:32.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:32.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.86,0:13:33.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:33.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.26,0:13:33.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:33.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.52,0:13:39.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先请  同为落单游客的珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:39.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you, fellow single rider Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.52,0:13:46.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请勿将手脚伸出船外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:46.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please keep your arms and legs inside at all times
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.57,0:13:49.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游览未完  不得下船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:49.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and do not leave the boat until the ride is over
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.84,0:13:50.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢配合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:50.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.75,0:13:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.75,0:13:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your arm
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,伸出船外了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's outside the boat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会把手伸回船上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will put my arm in the boat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.76,0:13:58.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是不准碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:58.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But don't touch me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.95,0:14:00.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:14:00.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更不准看我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't even look at me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boring
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的箭能射中她的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Will my arrow find her heart?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这游乐设施太土了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This ride is lame
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.32,0:14:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're allowed to speak now
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.67,0:14:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板玩这个一定会玩得特开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bet Mr. Krabs would get a kick out of this ride
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.53,0:14:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他虽然外表强硬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's so tough on the outside
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但内心也很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but he's got a soft side too
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从前有一次  我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, this one time I was upset
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我家小蜗生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because my snail Gary, he was sick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就让我提前五分钟走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he let me leave five minutes early
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是你听过最贴心的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't that he sweetest thing you've ever heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,非常无聊的两分钟后
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.69,0:14:44.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一次  蟹老板吼了我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:44.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then there was that time that Mr. Krabs yelled at me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我比他还早过来上班
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for getting to work before he did
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.42,0:14:47.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他连我工资都没扣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he didn't even dock my pay
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可真亲切啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a sweet man
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.97,0:14:53.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你害这隧道游更无聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:53.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are making this ride even more boring
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.10,0:14:54.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原本就无聊到不能再无聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:54.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if such a thing is possible
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该坐在座位上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to remain seated
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等游玩完全结
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until the ride comes to a complee-ee-eet
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.72,0:15:08.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:08.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甜心请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attention sweethearts
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们遇到了技术故障
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are experiencing technical difficulties
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.34,0:15:14.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请在座位上坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:14.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please remain seated
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好棒棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just great
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,三小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(692,778)}裤头村新闻
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,突发新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Breaking news
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.35,0:15:22.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手套隧道已变成惊魂隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:22.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The tunnel of glove has turned into a tunnel of terror
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:29.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(402,626)}警戒线  请勿跨越
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,数小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just hours ago
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.07,0:15:27.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,控制船的装置神秘停止工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the mechanism that controls the boats
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:27.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,mysteriously stopped
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,导致这对苦命鸳鸯受困在内
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,trapping the doomed couple inside
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.82,0:15:31.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,镜头前的是这对小年轻的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:31.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have the youths' friend here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.45,0:15:34.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早在那对甜心罹难前便逃出了隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who escaped the tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before tragedy befell the two sweethearts
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.78,0:15:38.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们千钧一发才成功逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:38.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We barely escaped with our lives
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.39,0:15:39.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:39.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was horrible
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.95,0:15:43.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你朋友叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:43.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what was the name of your friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.05,0:15:43.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:43.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.91,0:15:46.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有她男朋友海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:46.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And her boyfriend SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So there you have it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.02,0:15:50.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时间飞速流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:50.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As time quickly runs out
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.67,0:15:54.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,受困的鲸鱼女孩和海绵宝宝仍无消息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:51.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,still no word
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:54.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from the imperiled whale girl and SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我珊瑚棒吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm out of coral on a stick
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.69,0:16:02.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该来吃油炸藤壶了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:02.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to chomp through the fried barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,此时此刻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At this time
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.04,0:16:06.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄色小海绵能活下来的希望渺茫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:06.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,survival looks bleak for the little yellow sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我最可怕的噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is my worst nightmare
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have a drink
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.20,0:16:12.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:12.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doofus
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友困在手套隧道里了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your best buddy is trapped in the tunnel of glove
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可能永远都逃不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he may never escape
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.42,0:16:19.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说海绵宝宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:19.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.25,0:16:23.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:23.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.77,0:16:24.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:24.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都不许跨越这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one beyond this point
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友困在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My best buddy is trapped in there
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定要让我过去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to let me through
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  大块头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No can do, big guy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.95,0:16:32.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:32.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too dangerous
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.37,0:16:34.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:34.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个警察不让我走大门进去是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr. Police guy won't let me in the front, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我就自己想办法进去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll just have to find my own way in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,920)}手套乐园发电站
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:48.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(556,176)}禁止入内
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来想想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝会在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where could SpongeBob be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(712,310)}危险  禁止入内
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.95,0:16:51.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:51.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:54.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(690,816)}高压区域
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你找到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"You have fou
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Found
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.02,0:16:55.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:55.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your friend"
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.85,0:16:59.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝就在这扇门后边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:59.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob is right behind this door
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.02,0:17:01.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来救你了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:01.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to get you, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.41,0:17:04.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:04.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, there you are
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.75,0:17:07.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撑住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:07.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang in there
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来帮你挣脱镣铐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll free you from your shackles
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没事了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're okay now, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去快活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go to your happy place
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, little girl
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会尽快解决
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're working as fast as we can
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That wasn't me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.10,0:17:29.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:29.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, little boy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用苦恼  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't fret, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才一片黑暗而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just the dark
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑暗没什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing scary about the dark
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该小心的是黑暗里面的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's what's in the dark you got to watch out for
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.55,0:17:40.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪物  魑魅魍魉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:40.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Monsters, creeps, ghouls
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.69,0:17:41.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:41.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clowns
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.56,0:17:42.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巫婆  狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:42.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,witches, werewolves
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.74,0:17:43.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:43.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clowns
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊悚的东西  惊悚的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,crawly things, crawly clowns
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.47,0:17:46.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种东西最可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:46.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those are the worst
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.60,0:17:47.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊悚的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:47.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The crawly clowns
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随你便  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我自己找路出去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find my way out
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  我不会那么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, I wouldn't do that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把手脚伸出船外了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not keeping your arms and legs inside the boat
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  别走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.86,0:17:58.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该得陪你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:17:58.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should probably accompany you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.62,0:17:59.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是  以防
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:17:59.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, in case
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.69,0:18:01.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑暗中有东西  潜伏着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:01.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's anything in the darkness, lurking
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.22,0:18:07.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我就英勇无畏来带路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:07.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll just fearlessly lead the way
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.00,0:18:09.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:09.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snakes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是彩带  傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those are streamers, fool
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是待在这好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just stay up here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,留意有没有其他什么可怕玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,keep an eye out for any other creepies
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.73,0:18:19.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别幼稚了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:19.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grow up, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有可怕玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There aren't any creepies
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.52,0:18:23.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有惊悚玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:23.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There aren't any crawlies
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.35,0:18:24.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:24.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There aren't any snakes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.85,0:18:28.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别嚷嚷了  好好找出口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:28.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So stop whining so we can look for a way out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pearl, you've made you point
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.87,0:18:33.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就不说食人恶魔  还有吸血蝙蝠鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.87,0:18:33.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll stop talking about ogres and vampire bat fish
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有鲨鱼  还有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And sharks and
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.81,0:18:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I won't talk about
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.27,0:18:38.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:38.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Zombies
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.18,0:18:42.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者幽灵海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:42.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or ghostly pirates
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者实验室生物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or laboratory creatures
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.47,0:18:46.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:46.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者外星来的绿色生物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or green beings from another planet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.32,0:18:50.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你厉害  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:50.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.94,0:18:51.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我服了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:51.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者公交司机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or bus drivers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's enough
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.61,0:18:57.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听见没
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:57.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我怕了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm scared, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听着像是惊悚的狼丑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It sounded like a crawly wereclown
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本就没那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But there's no such thing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又输了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not another skunk
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.74,0:19:23.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么会又赢我一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:23.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you beat me again?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.52,0:19:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说你呢  你锁我朋友是觉得好笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, you find it funny to lock up my friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你说话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am talking towards you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.47,0:19:33.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你见过把这里搞乱的白痴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:33.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you see the dimwit who ripped this apart?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.40,0:19:38.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很可惜  我不知道那白痴是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:38.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I unfortunately have no idea who that dullard is
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我知道你绑架了海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do know that you kidnapped SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不认识你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know about your friend
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.35,0:19:43.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是个电工
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:43.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just the electrician
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.60,0:19:47.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道你是个魔法师了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:47.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see you are a magician
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.87,0:19:50.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你那巫毒法术没法掩盖你的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:50.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that voodoo does not erase what you've done
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.83,0:19:52.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:52.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You need to relax
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐好冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a seat and cool off
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  也太爱指手画脚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jeez, some people are so pushy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.34,0:19:56.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之别坐上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:56.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just don't sit on
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.48,0:19:57.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:57.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The lever
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.89,0:20:03.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在设施卡在危险的超快模式了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:03.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now the ride is stuck in dangerous super fast mode
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.09,0:20:04.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你要我坐的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:04.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You told me to sit on it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.74,0:20:09.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:09.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:11.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1046,608)}浪漫厅堂
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱紧我  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,浪漫厅堂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The hall of great romance
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好  我听清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I think I heard you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.85,0:20:26.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么东西都不会再坐上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:26.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will not sit on anything else
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.25,0:20:29.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只小心翼翼靠在这面墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:29.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just gingerly lean on this wall
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:31.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(736,376)}机械偶超控
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:31.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(774,788)}危险                                              请勿按下
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.22,0:20:34.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:34.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Noooooo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:40.13,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940,302)}安东尼和克利奥佩特拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:40.13,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 莎士比亚所著悲剧角色，两人最终殉情 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.08,0:20:37.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太浪漫了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How romantical
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.12,0:20:40.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我心目中的比这还盛大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:40.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I imagined it bigger
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.47,0:20:44.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:44.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可爱的小天使
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A sweet, adorable cherub
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.80,0:20:54.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  这应该不能算手套隧道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:54.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, I don't think this is the tunnel of glove
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.55,0:20:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是邪恶隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.55,0:20:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the tunnel of evil
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个傻孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gosh, stupid kid
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,厕所不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice facilities
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.51,0:21:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水压挺大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great water pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,900)}手套乐园泵房\N极高水压
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王的妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune's mother
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么动静
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她要喷水了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's gonna blow
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nooo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.89,0:22:09.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到头来还算是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:09.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess that turned out to be
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Kind of fun
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.17,0:22:12.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:12.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.89,0:22:16.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝就是你男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:16.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob is your boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.02,0:22:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得说多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to say it?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.62,0:22:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gross
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别不承认
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't deny it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚还抱了他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were totally hugging him
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都知道那基本就表示
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And everyone knows that totally means
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.99,0:22:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就是你的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he's totally your boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.55,0:22:35.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小朋友们好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.55,0:22:35.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, kids
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.38,0:22:37.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊悚的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:37.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crawly clown
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.30,0:22:38.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊悚的小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:38.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crawly clown
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们懂吧  姐妹们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand, girls
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.20,0:22:45.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当作传家宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:45.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For posterity
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还吃不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gonna finish that?
